title: 'Oxide, RFD 1, "Requests for Discussion": timely rather than polished, with a state that says where the idea stands.'
pid: 0e97c47c-2e2d-4b9b-bceb-8378673f0394
body: |2-
  https://rfd.shared.oxide.computer/rfd/0001
  States: prediscussion, ideation, discussion, published, committed
  (it now describes how the system works), abandoned. The author
  decides which feedback to take and when to merge; there is no
  approving body. Comments run 3-5 days.
